# Both are OPTIONAL. The site runs, builds and looks correct with this file absent
# — there are no credentials to obtain and no services to stand up. Copy to
# `.env.local` only when you need the join form to actually submit.
#
# Anything needed at build time on a static site is inlined into the bundle, so
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is not a mistake here: both of these are public by nature. Never
# put a secret in this file.

# Where the join form POSTs. Unset, the form renders and validates but does not
# submit — which is the correct local default, so nobody's test entries land in
# the real inbox.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APPLY_ENDPOINT=

# A real cohort deadline, shown next to the form. Unset, no deadline is claimed.
# Leave it empty rather than inventing one: a countdown to a date nobody agreed
# to is the kind of claim this site exists not to make.
NEXT_PUBLIC_COHORT_DEADLINE=
